      "Full monotonicity iff consecutive monotonicity for d >= 5",
      "Deficiency bound d(d) <= d implies monotonicity",
      "Complete graph optimality implies monotonicity",
      "f(d) >= C(d,2) for d >= 2 implies monotonicity"
